\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.20}{\ignorespaces From kernel syscalls to the Redis ingest list. Filebeat \cite {filebeat2024} tails Wazuh's \texttt  {alerts.json} with a one-second check interval and pushes each line into the Redis staging list. The Filebeat registry guarantees at-least-once delivery: if Redis dies, the offset is not advanced and Filebeat resumes from the last successful push on recovery.}}{80}{figure.4.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ch4:auditdflow}{{4.20}{80}{From kernel syscalls to the Redis ingest list. Filebeat \protect \cite {filebeat2024} tails Wazuh's \texttt {alerts.json} with a one-second check interval and pushes each line into the Redis staging list. The Filebeat registry guarantees at-least-once delivery: if Redis dies, the offset is not advanced and Filebeat resumes from the last successful push on recovery}{figure.4.20}{}}
